\n        <span>Menu</span>\n      </button>\n      <nav class=\"pb-nav\" id=\"pb-main-nav\" aria-label=\"Navigasi utama\">\n          <div class=\"region region-primary-menu\">\n    <drupal-render-placeholder callback=\"Drupal\\block\\BlockViewBuilder::lazyBuilder\" arguments=\"0=portal_budaya_main_menu&amp;1=full&amp;2\" token=\"3get4rgJJGVDUvbzZmCm27nBc-r6A_ERWUegX7dorOI\"></drupal-render-placeholder>\n  </div>\n\n          <div class=\"region region-secondary-menu\">\n    <drupal-render-placeholder callback=\"Drupal\\block\\BlockViewBuilder::lazyBuilder\" arguments=\"0=portal_budaya_account_menu&amp;1=full&amp;2\" token=\"tP4A8Z0JSLhQoyXrfymkiwym-019jAZCd2YXobt1oZo\"></drupal-render-placeholder>\n  </div>\n\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n      <div class=\"pb-highlighted\">  <div class=\"region region-highlighted\">\n    <div data-drupal-messages-fallback class=\"hidden messages-list\"></div><drupal-render-placeholder callback=\"Drupal\\Core\\Render\\Element\\StatusMessages::renderMessages\" arguments=\"0\" token=\"mljXt4H3lncs_pxKGqBCSVaOLIQ2sB0si7UedcPU9SY\"></drupal-render-placeholder>\n<drupal-render-placeholder callback=\"Drupal\\block\\BlockViewBuilder::lazyBuilder\" arguments=\"0=portal_budaya_primary_admin_actions&amp;1=full&amp;2\" token=\"z27IchZeXfoRe9yxEH8GqHlT1a3HKPzLJReeFQ6SH4k\"></drupal-render-placeholder><drupal-render-placeholder callback=\"Drupal\\block\\BlockViewBuilder::lazyBuilder\" arguments=\"0=portal_budaya_primary_local_tasks&amp;1=full&amp;2\" token=\"IL7IU23r20CnrGxTDj-enGJ2gNuDQq6voOUyfFWyz6k\"></drupal-render-placeholder><drupal-render-placeholder callback=\"Drupal\\block\\BlockViewBuilder::lazyBuilder\" arguments=\"0=portal_budaya_secondary_local_tasks&amp;1=full&amp;2\" token=\"kizOd168XmwY9DCwj0VxFyIslKdM6v9DohaajBf0RMY\"></drupal-render-placeholder>\n  </div>\n</div>\n  \n  <main id=\"main-content\">\n    <section class=\"pb-hero\">\n      <div class=\"pb-hero-overlay\"></div>\n      <div class=\"pb-hero-content\">\n        <p class=\"pb-eyebrow\">JEJAK BUDAYA · SURAKARTA</p>\n        <h1>Setiap warisan punya cerita.</h1>\n        <p>Temukan artefak, tradisi, tokoh, tempat bersejarah, dan dokumentasi yang merekam kekayaan budaya Surakarta.</p>\n        <div class=\"pb-hero-actions\">\n          <a class=\"pb-button pb-button-light\" href=\"/PortBudaya/web/katalog\">Jelajahi koleksi <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n          <a class=\"pb-text-link\" href=\"#tentang\">Tentang portal <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pb-hero-caption\">Merekam warisan, membuka pengetahuan.</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"pb-section pb-intro\" id=\"tentang\">\n      <div class=\"pb-section-kicker\">ARSIP YANG TERHUBUNG</div>\n      <div class=\"pb-intro-grid\">\n        <h2>Budaya bukan sekadar objek. Ia adalah jaringan cerita.</h2>\n        <div>\n          <p>Ruang Budaya Surakarta menghimpun informasi budaya dalam satu katalog digital. Setiap entri dapat terhubung dengan tokoh, tradisi, daerah, periode, dan tempat yang membentuk kisahnya.</p>\n          <p class=\"pb-muted\">Gunakan portal ini untuk menjelajah, belajar, mengajar, meneliti, dan mengenal warisan budaya daerah.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"pb-section pb-categories\">\n      <div class=\"pb-section-heading\">\n        <div><div class=\"pb-section-kicker\">JELAJAHI BERDASARKAN TEMA</div><h2>Ragam koleksi</h2></div>\n        <a class=\"pb-inline-link\" href=\"/PortBudaya/web/katalog\">Lihat katalog <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pb-category-grid\">\n        <a class=\"pb-category-card pb-cat-artifact\" href=\"/PortBudaya/web/katalog\"><span class=\"pb-category-number\">01</span><span class=\"pb-category-title\">Artefak & benda budaya</span><span class=\"pb-category-arrow\">↗</span></a>\n        <a class=\"pb-category-card pb-cat-tradition\" href=\"/PortBudaya/web/katalog\"><span class=\"pb-category-number\">02</span><span class=\"pb-category-title\">Tradisi & upacara</span><span class=\"pb-category-arrow\">↗</span></a>\n        <a class=\"pb-category-card pb-cat-people\" href=\"/PortBudaya/web/katalog\"><span class=\"pb-category-number\">03</span><span class=\"pb-category-title\">Tokoh & sejarah</span><span class=\"pb-category-arrow\">↗</span></a>\n        <a class=\"pb-category-card pb-cat-place\" href=\"/PortBudaya/web/katalog\"><span class=\"pb-category-number\">04</span><span class=\"pb-category-title\">Tempat bersejarah</span><span class=\"pb-category-arrow\">↗</span></a>\n        <a class=\"pb-category-card pb-cat-performing\" href=\"/PortBudaya/web/katalog\"><span class=\"pb-category-number\">05</span><span class=\"pb-category-title\">Seni pertunjukan</span><span class=\"pb-category-arrow\">↗</span></a>\n        <a class=\"pb-category-card pb-cat-archive\" href=\"/PortBudaya/web/katalog\"><span class=\"pb-category-number\">06</span><span class=\"pb-category-title\">Foto & arsip digital</span><span class=\"pb-category-arrow\">↗</span></a>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"pb-quote-band\">\n      <div class=\"pb-quote-mark\">“</div>\n      <blockquote>Merawat ingatan hari ini, agar warisan tetap hidup esok hari.</blockquote>\n      <p>RUANG BUDAYA SURAKARTA</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"pb-section pb-content-slot\">\n        <div class=\"region region-content\">\n    <div id=\"block-portal-budaya-content\" class=\"block block-system block-system-main-block\">\n  \n    \n      <div class=\"views-element-container contextual-region\"><div class=\"contextual-region view view-frontpage view-id-frontpage view-display-id-page_1 js-view-dom-id-466576289a7b5c952d3061e57d69c390153e0bd697d9359baf22b9ab25ddb1b9\">\n  \n    <div data-contextual-id=\"entity.view.edit_form:view=frontpage:location=page&amp;name=frontpage&amp;display_id=page_1&amp;langcode=id\" data-contextual-token=\"BJWvA9-fODMg_JBg0ivj7yrjkw