16,'Base field override','','none'),(5617,'Display prefix and suffix','','none'),(5618,'This path does not exist or you do not have permission to link to %path.','','none'),(5619,'Blocks are placed and configured specifically for each theme. The Block layout page opens with the default theme, but you can toggle to other installed themes.','','none'),(5620,'Comment operation links','','none'),(5621,'The target entity type can not be changed after the comment type has been created.','','none'),(5622,'Enable the personal contact form by default for new users','','none'),(5623,'Add contact form','','none'),(5624,'Edit contact form','','none'),(5625,'Default form identifier','','none'),(5626,'When listing forms, those with lighter (smaller) weights get listed before forms with heavier (larger) weights. Forms with equal weights are sorted alphabetically.','','none'),(5627,'Make this the default form','','none'),(5628,'Contact form %label has been updated.','','none'),(5629,'Contact form %label has been added.','','none'),(5630,'Send yourself a copy','','none'),(5631,'%sender-name (@sender-from) sent an email regarding %contact_form.','','none'),(5632,'The ID of the associated form.','','none'),(5633,'Users may translate this field','','none'),(5634,'Content translation field settings','','none'),(5635,'Field properties for which to synchronize translations','','none'),(5636,'Field column for which to synchronize translations','','none'),(5637,'The relative date value entered is invalid.','','none'),(5638,'Allowed types: @extensions.','','none'),(5639,'Back to content editing','','none'),(5640,'\n        <p>You can align images, videos, blockquotes and so on to the left, right or center. Examples:</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Align an image to the left: <code>&lt;img src=\"\" data-align=\"left\" /&gt;</code></li>\n          <li>Align an image to the center: <code>&lt;img src=\"\" data-align=\"center\" /&gt;</code></li>\n          <li>Align an image to the right: <code>&lt;img src=\"\" data-align=\"right\" /&gt;</code></li>\n          <li>… and you can apply this to other elements as well: <code>&lt;video src=\"\" data-align=\"center\" /&gt;</code></li>\n        </ul>','','none'),(5641,'Align images','','none'),(5642,'Uses a <code>data-align</code> attribute on <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> tags to align images.','','none'),(5643,'\n        <p>You can caption images, videos, blockquotes, and so on. Examples:</p>\n        <ul>\n            <li><code>&lt;img src=\"\" data-caption=\"This is a caption\" /&gt;</code></li>\n            <li><code>&lt;video src=\"\" data-caption=\"The Drupal Dance\" /&gt;</code></li>\n            <li><code>&lt;blockquote data-caption=\"Dries Buytaert\"&gt;Drupal is awesome!&lt;/blockquote&gt;</code></li>\n            <li><code>&lt;code data-caption=\"Hello world in JavaScript.\"&gt;alert(\"Hello world!\");&lt;/code&gt;</code></li>\n        </ul>','','none'),(5644,'Caption images','','none'),(5645,'Uses a <code>data-caption</code> attribute on <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> tags to caption images.','','none'),(5646,'One translation file could not be imported. See the log for details.@count translation files could not be imported. See the log for details.','','none'),(5647,'A flag for whether the link should be enabled in menus or hidden.','','none'),(5648,'The time that the menu link was last edited.','','none'),(5649,'The timestamp the latest revision of this node was created.','','none'),(5650,'Recently created','','none'),(5651,'Whether a new revision should be created by default','','none'),(5652,'Display author and date information','','none'),(5653,'Breakpoint ID','','none'),(5654,'Unable to delete the shortcut for %title.','','none'),(5655,'Drupal database update','','none'),(5656,'Maximum number of levels','','none'),(5657,'<strong>Back up your code</strong>. Hint: when backing up module code, do not leave that backup in the \'modules\' or \'sites/*/modules\' directories as this may confuse Drupal\'s auto-di